t Name:</strong> <label>{{ doc.lastname }}</label>\n                                </p>\n                            \n                            <!-- Download App Section -->\n                            <div style=\"background:#fffff0; width:auto; padding:15px; border-radius:10px; margin:20px auto; text-align:left; border:1px solid #eee\">\n                                <h5 style=\"margin:15px 0px; text-align: center;\">Flight Information / Message:</h5>\n                                {{doc.flight_itinerary}}\n                                \n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <p>\n                                If you have any questions,<br/>\n                                please do not hesitate to contact our team at:\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li><a href=\"mailto:contact@rarecruise.com\">contact@rarecruise.com</a></li>\n                                    <li><a href=\"https://wa.me/60127789060\">+60127789060 (KL)</a></li>\n                                    <li><a href=\"https://wa.me/60127789060\">+60127789060 (Singapore)</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </p>\n\n                            <p>\n                                We can\u2019t wait to welcome you onboard and create unforgettable memories together.\n                            </p>\n                            <p>\n                                Warm regards,<br />\n                                <strong>Rarecruise Team</strong><br />\n                                <small>Rarecation Travel Sdn Bhd</small>\n                            </p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Footer -->\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#f0f0f0; padding:15px; text-align:center; font-size:12px; color:#666;\">\n                            For inquiries, reply to